@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Flujo de Datos — Masimo Radical-7 (RS-232 ASCII)

actor "Masimo Radical-7\n(Dispositivo Medico)" as Device
participant "SerialProvider\n(PureJavaComm)" as Serial
participant "DemoRadical7\n(AbstractSerialDevice)" as Driver
participant "ASCIIFieldDelegate\n(Lector de lineas)" as Delegate
participant "MasimoRadical7\n(Parser de campos)" as Parser
participant "DDS Middleware\n(Publisher / Numeric)" as DDS

== Conexion ==

Driver -> Serial: connect(puerto, 9600 8N1)
Serial -> Device: abre puerto serie RS-232
Serial --> Driver: InputStream + OutputStream
Driver -> Driver: reportConnected()

== Recepcion de datos ==

loop Cada ~1 segundo, el dispositivo envia una linea ASCII

    Device -> Serial: linea de texto\n(SN=... SPO2=...% BPM=... PI=... etc.)
    Serial -> Driver: BufferedReader.readLine()

    Driver -> Delegate: parseLine(linea)
    activate Delegate

    Delegate -> Delegate: regex matchea contra\nmasimo-radical-7.spec

    Delegate -> Parser: asigna campos via reflection\n(spo2, heartRate, perfusionIndex, sphb,\nspoc, pvi, desat, campos EEG, etc.)
    activate Parser

    Delegate -> Parser: firePulseOximeter()
    activate Driver

    Parser -> Driver: firePulseOximeter() [callback]

    Driver -> DDS: numericSample() — SpO2 (%)
    Driver -> DDS: numericSample() — Pulse (bpm)
    Driver -> DDS: numericSample() — Perfusion Index
    Driver -> DDS: numericSample() — SpHb, SpOC, PVI, DESAT
    Driver -> DDS: numericSample() — EEG PSI, EMG, SEF
    Driver -> DDS: writeDeviceIdentity() — SN del dispositivo
    Driver -> DDS: writeDeviceAlert() — alarma activa

    deactivate Driver
    deactivate Parser
    deactivate Delegate

end

== Desconexion ==

Device ->x Serial: puerto cerrado / timeout
Serial -> Driver: socket closed
Driver -> DDS: unregister topics

@enduml
